<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57187" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κήρῐνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽκηρός</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>waxen</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1035
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archipp.
				3
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				191c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				197d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρίνα ὀπώρα</span>, i.e.
				<i>honey</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				75
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>pliable as wax</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς θυμοὺς . . κηρίνους ποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					633d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηρίνας τὰς ὑπολήεις ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>Epict.</u>
					3.16.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>wax-coloured, pallid</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκηριώθην</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of women,
				'<i>made up' with cosmetics</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				22
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				<u>VA</u>
				2.22
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
